(### 7. DATASET DESIGN & LINGUISTIC PREPROCESSING) '
() '
(#### 7.1 Dataset Schema & Curation) '
(Because authentic university grievance databases are protected under student privacy and FERPA ) '
() '
(**Target Categories:**) '
(1. `Academic`) '
