(#### 7.2 Negation & Urgency Preserving Preprocessor) '
(Standard stop-word removal strips tokens such as *"not", "no", "never", "without"*, which compl) '
() '
(The preprocessing engine \(`ml/preprocessing/text_cleaner.py`\):) '
(1. Expands colloquial Indian university acronyms: `HOD` $\\rightarrow$ *Head of Department*, `TC) '
(2. Retains essential negation tokens: $\\mathcal{N} = \\{\\text{no, not, never, neither, without, ) '
(3. Strips non-alphanumeric noise while preserving intra-word hyphens for location identifiers \() '
() '
